      "content": "it's just so quiet. like, i used to live for the sound of the crowd and the rhythm of the floor, but now i'm just sitting in this apartment and i don't even recognize the person in the mirror. it feels like the athlete died a long time ago, and i'm just... stuck living in the aftermath. it feels pointless to keep going when the part of me that actually mattered is just gone.mountains moved for",
